WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
Do you know why the military values your plainclothes doctrine so much?

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,220
Because of the abyss war

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,620
Essentially, it’s a bottomless pit that can never be filled.

4
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:09,820
Therefore, the federal government has set a war resource tax of up to 80%

5
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,620
Civilian gods work hard to survive

6
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,420
Obtained specialties of the Monster Essence Abyss

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,420
Most of them have to be handed over

8
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,220
But top talents like my Chu family

9
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:17,620
Has special exemption rights

10
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:21,420
Because we master the core evolutionary technology and high-level law weapons

11
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,620
Military logistics must support us

12
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,220
So not only do I feel less sleep

13
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,220
The military still has to give us some thin noodles

14
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,620
And the civilian god of war without background

15
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:33,020
In the end, he was just a higher-level cannon fodder.

16
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,020
Your waste of child violence remains in experience

17
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,620
Wait until the landscape reaches Silver level

18
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,420
You can’t afford the high maintenance costs either

19
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:41,020
We can't even bear the tax of eight federal soldiers.

20
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:44,020
But as long as you sign the Chu family’s Ke Qing Shen Yin Luck

21
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,220
Become my subordinate goddess

22
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:47,770
These problems can be easily solved

23
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,170
And you only need to add the core of God’s Domain

24
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,370
Open to Chu Family Research Institute

25
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:53,170
In return, share plainclothes evolution data from time to time

26
00:00:53,170 --> 00:00:55,770
The Chu family will give you a basic resource quota of 3 million faith points every month.

27
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:57,770
In addition, the military's taxes will be paid by the Chu family for you.

28
00:00:57,970 --> 00:00:59,970
The most important thing is when you are promoted to true god

29
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:01,970
The Chu family will give you a complete Xia Wei Divine Mark
